{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/06/22/8407498/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の工事中で\n掘り下げていただきました(๑⁰ -⁰)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恥ずかしくてまだ私は\n観れていません、、(笑)\nよかったら皆様感想を、、(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか番組前半の特集を\nやっていただける機会があれば、\n将棋のお話などできたらいいな...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして金つぶありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みささんの代打2回目にして\nコーナーをいただき、\n楽しくお話させていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"安保法制......難しかった（ ｉ _ ｉ ）\nでもとっても勉強になりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日放送のNOGIBINGO!4に\n私も出演しています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はわりと映ると思う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/06/22/8407498/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/06/22/8407498/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最終回ということで\n46万円でみんなでお買い物しました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひぜひご覧ください♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/06/22/8407498/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/06/22/8407498/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日の将棋フォーカスの｢１分切れ負け将棋｣\n初めて見たけどテンポ良くて面白かった(^^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も間近で見てて、\nもうなにがなんだか(๑⁰ -⁰)(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄すぎて凄すぎて凄すぎて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更にあの棋譜を覚えているって\nやっぱりプロの方は\n雲の上の存在です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/06/22/8407498/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「もと村」昨日？渋谷に新店舗オープンじゃなかった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日行ってみたけど並んでて断念した。。。\n時間のあるときにまたチャレンジする♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/06/22/8407498/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"賑やかし hinako(笑)こういう楽屋の雰囲気伝わる描写好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子はよく賑やかしてるよ～♡(笑)\nまたこういうことあったら\nいろいろ書きますね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りさこてゃんと純奈てゃんと\nディズニー行った時の写真(๑⁰ -⁰)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/06/22/8407498/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break